  "title": "Improving Treatment Adherence Through Collaborative Care Management",
  "summary": "Treatment adherence is crucial in achieving positive outcomes, yet despite its importance, non-adherence to prescribed treatments is a significant issue. Collaborative Care Management (CoCM) has emerged as a key solution to improving adherence rates, leveraging integrated approaches and advanced technologies to support patients more effectively. This blog explores how Collaborative Care Management models measure and enhance treatment adherence and provides recent, credible statistical data to support their impact.",
